          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "Israel joined himself to Baal Peor, and the LORD’s anger burned against Israel.",
      "ko": "이스라엘이 바알브올에게 부속된지라 여호와께서 이스라엘에게 진노하시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "fde4e3c74a60473501dbd04ddb962703537908b1d00d755bfc32723f659f986f",
      "translation_text_hash": "8f865ff9acf1fe36b096fa0293debef9c0bff9734da49677d186dfd61e155dff",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
